'''Lake Khantayskoye''' ({{langx|ru|Хантайское озеро}}) is a lake in [[Krasnoyarsk Krai]], [[Russia]].<ref>{{GSEn|118379|Хантайское озеро}}</ref>

It is located south of [[Lake Keta]].<ref name="GE">[[Google Earth]]</ref>

